# Burnside's theorem: groups of order p^a q^b are solvable
%%%
tag := "Chapter5/Theorem5.4.3"
number := false
%%%

**Theorem 5.4.3** (Burnside). _Any group $`G` of order $`p^a q^b`, where $`p` and $`q` are primes and $`a, b \geq 0`, is solvable._
